{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pulls/3","id":5035629889,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVZCWQs8AAAABLCWdQQ","html_url":"https://github.com/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pull/3.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/issues/3","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adongwanai/follow-rsi/statuses/380fb902ce42b8a5d6e9905222f89b63e28ab636","number":3,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[GATE BELOW THRESHOLD] 修复日报归期与补刊，落实来源审核和网站改版","user":{"login":"adongwanai","id":54011546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDExNTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54011546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai","html_url":"https://github.com/adongwanai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[GATE BELOW THRESHOLD] 最近完整 Harness 评测 precision 0.9231、recall 0.8571；召回低于 0.90。本 PR 保留告警和逐条出版检查，不把工程测试通过写成模型评测达标。\n\n修复日报长期停在审核队列、HF 旧榜单混进新一期和补刊审核日期混淆的问题。HF 日报现在只接受实际观察到的对应推荐日；补刊保留真实首次发现日，并分别显示刊期与实际审核日。页面增加空榜、撤回和无合格内容的更新说明，继续保留 10/27 撤回页与历史回顾。\n\n本分支同时汇总已完成的网站与 README 改版、来源追踪及历史审核：1,317 个规范记录 ID（不等同不同作品），680 条已有范围意见批准回执，17 条漏入库 HF 记录恢复，40 条旧双重审查索引补齐。论文科学字段及 unknown 保持，来源差异和后续纠正单独留痕。RSIHub/HarnessDev 的评测定位、通用 RSI 边界、文章与阅读路线更新均随分支提交。\n\n10/28、10/30、11/2 的日期审核草稿已隔离校验，分别准备 1、1、3 篇日报；这些草稿将在独立的日期审核 PR 产生真实 owner 合并回执后发布。AdaPRA 因复审反证继续 defer。手动停用的 feed-publish 工作流不在此 PR 中恢复。\n\n验证：354 项 pytest 通过；107 篇证据库记录、9 条路线校验通过；590 个生成文件两次构建一致；README 手写内容不变；3 份日期审核草稿逐条校验通过（5 accept、98 reject、1 defer）。本批无付费模型调用。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:29:29Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:27:25Z","closed_at":"2026-11-02T08:27:25Z","merged_at":"2026-11-02T08:27:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"1eff06bc1df40b6072e512a859ea4760331237d5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"adongwanai:fix/reviewed-news-and-public-site","ref":"fix/reviewed-news-and-public-site","repo":{"id":1435539010,"node_id":"R_kgDOVZCWQg","name":"follow-rsi","full_name":"adongwanai/follow-rsi","owner":{"login":"adongwanai","id":54011546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDExNTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54011546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai","html_url":"https://github.com/adongwanai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adongwanai/